      "content": "A precision 2.5 V DC  reference voltage is generated on the APP PWA for use by the pressure sensor excitation circuits, the air sensor amplifier circuits, and the ADC and DAC reference voltage. The precision 2.5 V DC  reference is buffered by a voltage follower. The signal name is V2_5.",
